If you like the tty mode as opposed to tiles, then the menucolors patch
lets you set the text color of items in a menu - like your inventory
menu, spells menu, etc - according to what it matches.  I have the
expression *cancellation* bound to print text in reverse (black on
white) so I see it every time I look at my inventory, reminding me not
to put it in the bag.

The menucolors patch does not affect gameplay or savefile/bonesfile
compatibility in any way.  God bless its author.



